---
// Component: ResponseTimeStats.astro
// Visual response time statistics, real metrics, and arrival speed chart across all communes
// Zero emojis and zero em dashes
---

<section class="py-16 bg-brand-surface border-t border-brand-border" aria-labelledby="response-stats-heading">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <!-- Section Heading -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-14">
      <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-brand-red mb-2 block">
        Chronomètre & Vitesse d'Intervention
      </span>
      <h2 id="response-stats-heading" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight">
        Statistiques & Engagements de Rapidite
      </h2>
      <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-brand-muted mt-3 leading-relaxed">
        En cas de fuite d'eau abondante ou d'engorgement sanitaire, chaque minute perdue augmente le risque de sinistre materiel. Nos camionnettes ateliers sont pre-positionnees pour reduire le trajet au strict minimum.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Top Key Metrics Cards -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-12">
      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-border shadow-xs text-center space-y-1">
        <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-brand-red block leading-none">24 min</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy block pt-1">Delai Moyen Constate</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] text-brand-muted block">Sur l'ensemble du Grand Mouscron</span>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-border shadow-xs text-center space-y-1">
        <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-brand-navy block leading-none">98.4%</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy block pt-1">Sur Place en Moins de 30 Min</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] text-brand-muted block">Respect strict des creneaux d'urgence</span>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-border shadow-xs text-center space-y-1">
        <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-brand-red block leading-none">24/7/365</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy block pt-1">Astreinte Permanente</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] text-brand-muted block">Nuits, samedis, dimanches et feries</span>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-border shadow-xs text-center space-y-1">
        <span class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-brand-navy block leading-none">8 500+</span>
        <span class="text-xs font-bold text-brand-navy block pt-1">Depannages Reussis</span>
        <span class="text-[11px] text-brand-muted block">15+ annees de presence locale</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Detailed Communes Speed Chart -->
    <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl border border-brand-border p-7 sm:p-10 shadow-xs">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-8">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand-red block mb-1">
          Mesures de Trajet Reelles
        </span>
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy">
          Delais d'Arrivee Conformes par Commune
        </h3>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-brand-muted mt-1">
          Chronometrage effectue entre la confirmation telephonique et l'arrivee de la camionnette devant votre porte.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <!-- 1. Mouscron Centre -->
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-brand-navy">
            <span>Mouscron Centre, Tuquet, Mont-a-Leux (7700)</span>
            <span class="text-brand-red">20 min (Garanti sous 30 min)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-brand-surface rounded-full h-3 overflow-hidden border border-brand-border">
            <div class="bg-brand-red h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-1000" style="width: 88%"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 2. Luingne -->
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-brand-navy">
            <span>Luingne Village & La Royere (7700)</span>
            <span class="text-brand-red">22 min (Garanti sous 30 min)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-brand-surface rounded-full h-3 overflow-hidden border border-brand-border">
            <div class="bg-brand-red h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-1000" style="width: 82%"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 3. Herseaux -->
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-brand-navy">
            <span>Herseaux-Gare & Herseaux-Place (7712)</span>
            <span class="text-brand-red">24 min (Garanti sous 30 min)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-brand-surface rounded-full h-3 overflow-hidden border border-brand-border">
            <div class="bg-brand-red h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-1000" style="width: 78%"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 4. Dottignies -->
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-brand-navy">
            <span>Dottignies & Cite Claudel (7711)</span>
            <span class="text-brand-navy">28 min (Garanti sous 35 min)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-brand-surface rounded-full h-3 overflow-hidden border border-brand-border">
            <div class="bg-brand-navy h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-1000" style="width: 70%"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 5. Estaimpuis -->
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-brand-navy">
            <span>Estaimpuis, Nechin & Leers-Nord (7730)</span>
            <span class="text-brand-navy">29 min (Garanti sous 35 min)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-brand-surface rounded-full h-3 overflow-hidden border border-brand-border">
            <div class="bg-brand-navy h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-1000" style="width: 67%"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 6. Tourcoing -->
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-brand-navy">
            <span>Tourcoing & Zone Frontaliere (59200)</span>
            <span class="text-brand-red">25 min (Garanti sous 30 min)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-brand-surface rounded-full h-3 overflow-hidden border border-brand-border">
            <div class="bg-brand-red h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-1000" style="width: 75%"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 7. Comines-Warneton -->
        <div class="space-y-1">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs sm:text-sm font-bold text-brand-navy">
            <span>Comines-Warneton & Ploegsteert (7780 via N58)</span>
            <span class="text-brand-navy">30 min (Garanti sous 35 min)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="w-full bg-brand-surface rounded-full h-3 overflow-hidden border border-brand-border">
            <div class="bg-brand-navy h-full rounded-full transition-all duration-1000" style="width: 65%"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Logistics Footnote -->
      <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-brand-border flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs">
        <p class="text-brand-muted">
          Flotte d'intervention localisee a proximite immediate de la N58 et de la Rue de Menin, equipee de materiel de pointe pret a l'emploi.
        </p>
        <a href="tel:+32490067245" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl bg-brand-navy hover:bg-brand-red text-white font-bold transition flex items-center gap-1.5 shrink-0">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-red" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
            <path d="M2 3a1 1 0 011-1h2.153a1 1 0 01.986.836l.74 4.435a1 1 0 01-.54 1.06l-1.548.773a11.037 11.037 0 006.105 6.105l.774-1.548a1 1 0 011.059-.54l4.435.74a1 1 0 01.836.986V17a1 1 0 01-1 1h-2C7.82 18 2 12.18 2 4V3z"></path>
          </svg>
          Declencher un depart au 0490 06 72 45
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
